    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>No further antibiotics. [S]</item><item>No repeat Brucella serology. [S]</item><item>If a temperature of 38 °C or more lasts longer than three days, or night sweats or new localized back, hip, or joint pain appear, draw two sets of blood cultures and call me; spinal MRI only if focal back pain develops. [S]</item><item>Complete one-time HIV, hepatitis B, and hepatitis C screening at her preventive visit. [S]</item><item>Agree with managing her symptoms as ME/CFS under Dr. Marchetti, by NICE NG206. [S]</item><item>Discussed with Dr. Marchetti today; the patient understands the plan and the warning signs. [S]</item><item>Follow-up: No routine infectious diseases follow-up. I will see her again if the warning signs appear. [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
